          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini kitïta chane wölay le möngot, kïporyeghö pipö Israel chane kiryagh ompö tawungwa. Atolapay kulet tagh pïchay pö Israel kïparata pipö Moap ntökwit korengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunyar kanastin akïwirchï chi anka tïkwïl koghïn kor wölo akwagh ntökulum akïtïpö koghïn kori pöghon löwïr akïtör keti akwa löwïr, kïpoto kanasyanta Kirareset nyo kingötï, wölo ato mi löt kïporyeghö nyoni tïkwïl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
