          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa pöytoghinto Moap lö kikerïnta pipö lïkenyi, kumukyï nko pikachi 700 cho tïng chokon lö kïlïtöy kwenu pungkökwa tökepe ketuyenö nko pipö pöytoghinto Sirya wölo kupöl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïcheng werïnyi nyo le poret nyo kikeröy nyinte kïpöytoy akïropta ompö kanasyan sany kïlïkwï amöros nyo kïpelöy ompö tororöt pö Moap. Kwotyö pipö Israel nyoman ompö kïyoni kigh nyinte kuyodegha kegh kanasyantanay kutang korengwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
